# Build outputs and caches
build/
.pio/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
capture/

# doc/ is local-only and deliberately untracked: vendor datasheets, the NanoBerry
# schematic, and the 434 MB reference capture. They are third-party or raw input
# rather than project source, and this repository is public.
#
# Obtain them separately and place them here:
#     doc/NanEyeC_DS000503_3-00.pdf   datasheet (ams-OSRAM)
#     doc/NanEyeC_AN000611_2-00.pdf   MCU interface app note (ams-OSRAM)
#     doc/nanoberry_board.pdf         NanoBerry schematic
#     doc/digital.csv                 reference Saleae capture
#
# Nothing in the build or the test suite requires them: the essential part of the
# capture is committed as firmware/src/golden_vector.h (one real sensor row plus
# its expected pixels), and tests needing the full capture skip when it is absent.
doc/
.venv/
site/
.vscode/
